Package: couchlink-host
Version: 0.1.1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: couchlink <https://github.com/jrb00013/couchlink>
Depends: libx11-6, libxcb1, udev, policykit-1
Recommends: coturn, zenity
Description: Couchlink host (screen share + virtual DualSense for emulators)
 Installs once with admin password: udev rule for /dev/uinput and desktop
 launchers. After log-out/in, double-click Couchlink Host — no terminal.
